<template><div><h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Survival edition and equipment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-survival-edition" data-guide-step>This is the endless survival edition, separate from its ten-wave Tortured Path story chapter. Its ordinary battery unlocks use waves 1, 5 and 10. There is no story chapter’s final-wave extraction; plan for continuing waves after setup.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-pap">Three survival batteries: waves 1, 5 and 10</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-survival-batteries" data-guide-step>Charge the green-lit battery with nearby kills at behind Windmill on wave 1, Wine Cellar from wave 5 and outside the bombed house across from Lee Enfield from wave 10. Each stops collecting and extinguishes its light when full. Completing all three unlocks Ubersprengen.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0630.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0630.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 survival battery: behind Windmill&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 survival battery: behind Windmill&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0630&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0631.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0631.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 5 survival battery: Wine Cellar&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 5 survival battery: Wine Cellar&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0631&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0632.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0632.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 10 survival battery: outside the bombed house across from Lee Enfield&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 10 survival battery: outside the bombed house across from Lee Enfield&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0632&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-pap-upgrade">Sixteen-duck gallery for the PaP fuse</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-bodega-duck" data-guide-step>Use a scoped weapon to shoot the rubber duck on the far wall of the bridge behind Windmill. Sixteen target ducks rise and sink; shoot every one before it disappears. A dressed animal holding balloons rises on the left when successful. A failed gallery can be retried next round.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0633.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0633.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Starter rubber duck beyond bridge&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Starter rubber duck beyond bridge&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0633&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-bodega-fuse" data-guide-step>Collect the fuse on the ground behind you. It automatically fits Ubersprengen, enabling Tesla Gun, Ripsaw and ordinary melee weapon upgrades into their Shadowed Throne versions.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0634.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0634.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Duck-gallery fuse drop&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Duck-gallery fuse drop&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0634&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-sword">Sword unlock: seven 1,750-Jolt payments</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-sword-prerequisite" data-guide-step>Complete the full Tortured Path main quest at least once on the profile before attempting this Sword route. Budget 12,250 Jolts for seven separate payments; completing this survival map’s Pack-a-Punch alone does not grant that campaign prerequisite.</li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-1" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at wine rack left of Speed Cola. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0635.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0635.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 1: wine rack left of Speed Cola&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 1: wine rack left of Speed Cola&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0635&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-2" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at grass left of dead cow. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0636.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0636.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 2: grass left of dead cow&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 2: grass left of dead cow&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0636&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-3" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at rubble right of blue truck. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0637.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0637.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 3: rubble right of blue truck&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 3: rubble right of blue truck&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0637&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-4" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at barrels left of exterior cellar stairs. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0638.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0638.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 4: barrels left of exterior cellar stairs&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 4: barrels left of exterior cellar stairs&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0638&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-5" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at box right of the painting truck in front of Windmill. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0639.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0639.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 5: box right of the painting truck in front of Windmill&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 5: box right of the painting truck in front of Windmill&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0639&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-6" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at bucket right of Windmill gears. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0640.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0640.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 6: bucket right of Windmill gears&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 6: bucket right of Windmill gears&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0640&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-7" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at rubble in front of broken-house Armour. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0641.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0641.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 7: rubble in front of broken-house Armour&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 7: rubble in front of broken-house Armour&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0641&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-down" data-guide-step>After all seven payments, stand in the glowing ring between the two trucks in front of Windmill and deliberately let a zombie down you. The scripted instant revive gives Sword. Other perks remain, but solo Quick Revive is lost; this intentional ritual has different consequences from the Frozen Dawn Shield trial.<p class="guide-callout">Perform the intentional down only inside the activated glowing ring.</p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0642.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0642.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword ritual glowing ring&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword ritual glowing ring&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0642&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-survival">Maintain armour, ammunition and a retreat route</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-survival-loop" data-guide-step>Keep an upgraded weapon with a reliable refill route, armour and room to retreat before using Ubersprengen or purchasing perks. Save tactical distractions for a cornered player or revive. Completing the fuse/Sword routes improves equipment; it does not end this survival match.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/bodega_cervantes_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
